## AI Visibility Methodology

The AI Visibility methodology assesses observable conditions that may help a website be discovered, retrieved and interpreted by artificial intelligence systems.

Source selection varies by product and may combine training data, search indexes, retrieval, live fetching and ranking. Clarity, structure and trust signals are reviewable inputs, not a complete model of proprietary selection systems.

The TH Analytica Framework evaluates these elements to identify gaps and prioritise improvements. It does not estimate a guaranteed mention or recommendation rate.
